# Benchmark artefacts -- machine-specific, regenerated on every run.
# We keep the aggregated cross-machine-comparable outputs (all_results.json,
# all_results.tsv, overview_plot.png, dashboard/) but exclude the raw per-
# model run directories so your runs don't collide with the reference run
# shipped in the repo.
results/*/
!results/dashboard/

# Auto-generated machine-specific files
models_config.json
report.txt
